        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Thanks @Labeeb2339\r\n\r\nI noticed the reason for the CI failure, and that is why I converted it to a draft. I have yet to figure out if there is even a way to add additional help tags, and what the proper way to document operator overloads is.\r\n\r\n(I'll be sure to fix the typo)",
